1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,684
<i>Hiding from my own company. In a
closet.</i>

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,459
…Who's Mr. Cole?

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,052
Cole's a— family name. It's
complicated. It's my dad's card.

4
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,777
He's… a lot.

5
00:00:14,897 --> 00:00:16,593
<i>Lie number one. I'm counting.</i>

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:19,751
Your dad's fraud team called about a
tamale.

7
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:23,332
He's very thorough.

8
00:00:23,452 --> 00:00:24,090
Clearly.

9
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:25,759
brave

10
00:00:25,879 --> 00:00:27,897
<i>Brave. That makes one of us.</i>

11
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,258
<i>Bathroom? For twenty minutes?</i>

12
00:00:32,150 --> 00:00:34,653
Our CEO is joining remotely. Camera
off.

13
00:00:39,150 --> 00:00:43,906
<i>Four years. Never seen his face. Bad
connection, my butt.</i>

14
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,692
<i>I'm the black square.</i>

15
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:50,619
Oh. Um. Abby? Product Design?

16
00:00:51,150 --> 00:00:56,169
Me? Okay. Honestly? We get paid fine.
But nobody goes anywhere.

17
00:00:57,150 --> 00:00:59,717
Everybody eats at their desk. It's
kind of sad.

18
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:05,077
<i>She's talking to me. She has no idea.</i>

19
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:09,976
<i>The CEO knows my name. Okay. Okay!</i>

20
00:01:10,650 --> 00:01:15,644
Thanks, Abby. Great segue. Starting
Friday, an efficiency review. Design
goes first.

21
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:18,747
<i>Friday? I said two weeks.</i>

22
00:01:20,150 --> 00:01:24,637
<i>They froze my review. For this.
Friday.</i>

23
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:26,004
Where were you?

24
00:01:26,124 --> 00:01:26,777
Copier.

25
00:01:26,897 --> 00:01:28,279
We don't have a copier.

26
00:01:29,150 --> 00:01:31,706
<i>Not counting that one. I don't have
the energy.</i>

27
00:01:33,150 --> 00:01:36,695
Friday they review us. Tonight I need
something to look forward to.

28
00:01:42,150 --> 00:01:44,293
Pick one. No pressure. Huge pressure.

29
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:49,539
<i>Phones off. Somewhere Grant can't find
me.</i>

30
00:01:49,659 --> 00:01:50,608
Look at you.

31
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,255
<i>Floor four?</i>

32
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:58,253
<i>Well, well.</i>
